<title>JAPAN: Japan 96 industrial output rises 2.6 pct -- MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan 96 industrial output rises 2.6 pct -- MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's industrial production in 1996 increased a preliminary 2.6 percent from the previous year, the Ministry of International Trade and Industry (MITI) said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>A breakdown of the preliminary yearly figures follows:</p>
<p>Unadjusted year-on-year (in pct), index base 1990:</p>
<p>				  1996	YEAR AGO     1996 INDEX</p>
<p> Output			 +2.6	+3.4	  97.6</p>
<p> Shipments		    +2.9	+2.7	  99.2</p>
<p> Inventories		  -1.9	+6.0	 106.1</p>
<p>Inventories to</p>
<p>    Shipments ratio	 +0.0	+1.3	 115.8</p>
</text>
